WEBVTT

00:09:28.105 --> 00:09:30.816
and some frequencies are light.

00:09:31.525 --> 00:09:36.655
And some take a half a lifetime

00:09:36.697 --> 00:09:38.907
to reach their destination.

00:09:40.618 --> 00:09:44.538
(Music)

00:09:46.957 --> 00:09:51.712
(Singing) Light is particle and wave

00:09:54.632 --> 00:09:59.762
Our histories written large upon the page